"hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:"
2736,"Abu Bakr bin Ishaq narrated to us, saying: Al-Hasan bin Musa Al-Ashyab narrated to us, saying: Thabit bin Yazid, Abu Yazid Al-Ahwal, narrated to me, from Abdullah bin Uthman bin Khuthaym, from Sa'id bin Jubayr, from Ibn Abbas (RA), who said: The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said: ""Indeed, this Stone has a tongue and two lips, and it will testify on the Day of Resurrection on behalf of"
